# Session planning material (plans, specs, reports). Untracked on 2026-09-07: 49 files
# that nothing links to and that the release zip already excluded, in a repository meant
# to be read by merchants and agencies.
#
# The history is deliberately NOT rewritten, so the documents that ~24 files under src/ and
# tests/ cite by path are still retrievable:
#
#   git show 2f3aca8:docs/superpowers/reports/2026-08-25-shopinfo-threshold.md
#
# (any commit before the removal works). Kept out of the zip by .shopware-extension.yml
# too, which stays as it is so a local copy can never reach an artefact.
docs/superpowers/
